      "text" : "[Edgar]",
      "translation" : "[埃德加]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 24,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "So are you heading to Alberta again? Let me give you the same discount and only charge 250 Zeny, just like the last time.",
      "translation" : "你又要去艾尔贝塔吗？我还是给你和上次一样的折扣，只收250 Zeny。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 25,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "How's that sound?",
      "translation" : "怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 27,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Alrighty~!",
      "translation" : "好啊~！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 27,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Why are you being so nice to me?!",
      "translation" : "你为什么对我这么好？！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 29,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Edgar]",
      "translation" : "[埃德加]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 30,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Um...",
      "translation" : "嗯..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 31,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "This isn't",
      "translation" : "钱"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 32,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "enough money.",
      "translation" : "不够。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 33,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Why don't you go",
      "translation" : "你为什么不去"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 34,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "get some more cash?",
      "translation" : "再弄点现金呢？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 41,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Edgar]",
      "translation" : "[埃德加]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 42,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "It's just the way I am. That, and your devilish smile reminds me of my beloved blond haired son who left home years ago to become a Sailor on his own ship. Bless his soul, wherever he is.",
      "translation" : "我就是这样的人。再说，你那淘气的笑容让我想起我心爱的金发儿子。他几年前离家，驾驶自己的船出海当水手了。愿他的灵魂安息，无论他身在何处。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 45,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Edgar]",
      "translation" : "[埃德加]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 46,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "My town, Izlude, is connected to Alberta by the harbor in the West. There is so much traffic between us, I almost become an Albertian.  Hehehe~",
      "translation" : "我的家乡伊斯鲁德通过西边的港口与艾尔贝塔相连。两地往来频繁，我都快成艾尔贝塔人了。嘿嘿~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 48,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Edgar]",
      "translation" : "[埃德加]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 49,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "There's this guy I know pretty well, Phelix, who lives in Alberta. That guy is really stingy... He charges for everything!",
      "translation" : "我认识一个住在艾尔贝塔的人，叫菲利克斯。那家伙特别吝啬...什么都要收费！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 51,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Edgar]",
      "translation" : "[埃德加]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 52,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "But he's really a nice guy and likes helping other people. He has a good heart and will give you his support if you meet his price.",
      "translation" : "不过他人真的很好，也喜欢帮助别人。他心地善良，只要你付得起价钱，他就会支持你。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 54,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Edgar]",
      "translation" : "[埃德加]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 55,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Lately, people in Alberta say that he is really trying to help folks and that his demand for Jellopies is just a coverup.  Well, you should take a look at what he has to offer.",
      "translation" : "最近艾尔贝塔的人都说他很热心助人，他收集果冻块只是个幌子。你应该去看看他能提供什么。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 57,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Can you tell me how to get to Alberta?",
      "translation" : "你能告诉我怎么去艾尔贝塔吗？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 57,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "End Conversation",
      "translation" : "结束对话"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 58,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Edgar]",
      "translation" : "[埃德加]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 59,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Huh? Well, you can use your feet and just walk.  But if you have money, I'd like to suggest that you take a ship.",
      "translation" : "啊？你可以用脚走过去。不过如果你有钱，我建议你坐船。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 61,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Okay, gotcha.",
      "translation" : "好，知道了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 61,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "But I'm sick of walking and I'm broke!",
      "translation" : "可是我走累了，而且身无分文！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 62,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Edgar]",
      "translation" : "[埃德加]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 63,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Alrighty, take care~",
      "translation" : "好吧，保重~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 66,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Edgar]",
      "translation" : "[埃德加]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 67,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Okay...",
      "translation" : "好吧..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 68,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You don't want to walk AND you've got no cash, but you still want to go there? Oh geez...",
      "translation" : "你不想走路，又没钱，却还想去那里？真是的..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 70,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Edgar]",
      "translation" : "[埃德加]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 71,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Fine fine. Me, being the captain of a ship, can afford to bring you there at a lower price. How does 250 Zeny sound?",
      "translation" : "好吧好吧。我是船长，能以便宜些的价格送你过去。250 Zeny怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 73,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Alrighty~!",
      "translation" : "好啊~！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 73,
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Bah, what a rip off!!",
      "translation" : "呸，太贵了！！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 76,
      "state" : "translated",
